    "no acceptance-criteria annotations",
    "dataset cutoff 2025-08-01: stale vs newer agents",
    "HF file sizes differ from the Zenodo v3 release (all_pull_request 6.7 GB vs 331 MB): versions differ, pin one",
    "merge is a noisy proxy for correctness",
    "personal data in free text (see DATA_HYGIENE.md)"
